Hi!

The Berlin minisummit is getting closer, so I started putting together a
schedule.

First off, please go to
http://wireless.kernel.org/en/developers/Summits/Berlin-2009

and add yourself as attending if you haven't already (or I haven't done
it for you).

Then check out
http://wireless.kernel.org/en/developers/Summits/Berlin-2009#Schedule
for the tentative schedule I just hacked together. If you have any
conflicts, problems with it, anything we should add, let me know. I'd
prefer if we didn't have a whole bunch of people moving things around,
but feel free to edit it too.

How much do we want to schedule for Sunday, if anything?

johannes

